id=deverizonficator
name=DeVerizonficator
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Hacktimepixel
description=Unlocks non-Verizon SIMs on Verizon Pixel 6a SKUs: clears the FCM-provisioned carrier-restriction profile cached by com.google.android.apps.work.oobconfig so SimLockTask falls back to all-carriers-allowed at every boot. Validated live: CARDSTATE_RESTRICTED -> CARDSTATE_PRESENT.
